{UTF-8}
{ Chapter 3: a team with steady hiring and a constant attrition fraction. The first-order stock that finds its own balance. }
Planned Hiring=
	10
	~	people/month
	~	Hires the budget allows each month.
	|
Hiring=
	Planned Hiring
	~	people/month
	~	New staff joining each month.
	|
Attrition Fraction=
	0.025
	~	1/month
	~	Share of staff leaving each month (2.5% a month, about 26% a year).
	|
Attrition=
	Staff * Attrition Fraction
	~	people/month
	~	Staff leaving each month.
	|
Initial Staff=
	100
	~	people
	~	|
Staff= INTEG(
	Hiring - Attrition,
	Initial Staff)
	~	people
	~	People on the payroll.
	|
INITIAL TIME = 0 ~ month ~ |
FINAL TIME = 160 ~ month ~ |
TIME STEP = 0.125 ~ month ~ |
SAVEPER = 0.125 ~ month ~ |
